  "body": "### Summary\nAs a VoiceOver user in Favoris, I want each category section title read with its name, so that I know which category a tap opens.\n\n### Facts\nFound in the adversarial review of #744 (#427): `TopicListView.swift:215` sets `.accessibilityLabel(\"Ouvrir le forum\")` on the clickable section title, which replaces the category name; every section title is read identically.\n\n### Fix\nKeep the category name as the label, add « Ouvrir le forum » as an `accessibilityHint` (and the button trait); a test on the label/hint.\n\n`status: blocked` until #744 merges, then ready. Refs #427, LOT-162.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
