   "body": "/claim cloud/i769-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- In `TopicListView.header`, drop the `accessibilityLabel(\"Ouvrir le forum\")` that replaced the category name; the title keeps its text as label, gets `.accessibilityHint(\"Ouvrir le forum\")` and the button trait.\n- Put the hint and the label in `TopicRowCues` (pure, testable) so the view and the test share one source.\n- Add Swift Testing tests on the label (= category name) and the hint, shown red without the change.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
